{
 "slug": "backing-up-your-data",
 "title": "Backing up your data",
 "subtitle": "Google shouldn't be your only guarantee",
 "description": "Google shouldn't be your only guarantee",
 "post_date": "2026-05-15T10:28:03.585Z",
 "cover_image": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp",
 "canonical_url": "https://croissanthology.substack.com/p/backing-up-your-data",
 "wordcount": 625,
 "audience": "everyone",
 "body_html": "<p>Claude Mythos has found a zero day in MacOS and Linux, and it won't be alone for long; its existence will cause entities who've been hoarding zero days for a while to spend all their cards <em>now</em>; Google <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/ai-vulnerability-exploitation-initial-access?utm_source=tw&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_campaign=nfg\">has found</a> at least one instance of a hacker using an ai-assisted zero-day; if claims are true that open-source models are always ~8 months behind the big labs, then we can expect democratized Mythos capabilities in early 2027. </p><p>In the limit, this could provide a far safer, essentially invulnerable internet:  </p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;a2c3fd73-efc4-4dba-83a4-45dc6cff56c3&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Are LLMs-in-cybersecurity defense or offense dominant? Opus 4.6 saturated Anthropic's cybersecurity benchmarks, and Claude Code has been used for successful cyberattacks at least once. To develop context windows which jailbreak Opus 4.6 is not terribly difficult&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:&quot;Read full story&quot;,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;sm&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;LLM cybersecurity risks in the long run are probably exaggerated &quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:334037963,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Croissanthology&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Rough drafts / musings go on Substack, because Substack does not deserve my most mature thoughts. Croissanthology.com does!&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f066c861-7480-4d04-bb0d-2396829bdc44_708x708.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-02-18T01:36:46.778Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e6a69b23-70d9-4dbb-b35c-7c5096436e14_2168x1222.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://croissanthology.substack.com/p/llm-cybersecurity-risks-in-the-long&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:187851658,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:9,&quot;comment_count&quot;:1,&quot;publication_id&quot;:4746392,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Croiss Lite&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>But this transition might be rough. And hackers finding zero days isn't the only threat out there. The US government <a href=\"https://www.aclu.org/press-releases/aclu-moves-to-quash-abusive-subpoena-aimed-at-tracking-down-man-who-criticized-department-of-homeland-security\">is pressuring</a> some people to give up their data, has <a href=\"https://www.propublica.org/article/videos-ice-dhs-immigration-agents-using-chokeholds-citizens\">stolen phones,</a> and if handed a warrant, has legal power over all which Google can see (e.g. everything in Photos and Drive), <a href=\"https://transparencyreport.google.com/user-data/overview?hl=en\">which it </a><em><a href=\"https://transparencyreport.google.com/user-data/overview?hl=en\">has</a></em><a href=\"https://transparencyreport.google.com/user-data/overview?hl=en\"> employed before.</a> Armed marauders have threatened people by force to give up their <a href=\"https://github.com/jlopp/physical-bitcoin-attacks/blob/master/README.md\">Bitcoin keys.</a> Nation-states presumably still regularly use <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pegasus_(spyware)\">Pegasus,</a> or whatever the newest version of it is. <a href=\"https://www.propublica.org/article/videos-ice-dhs-immigration-agents-using-chokeholds-citizens\">Google</a> and <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/our-agreement-with-the-department-of-war/\">OpenAI</a> have agreed to help the US government if it chooses to build an automated surveillance network. Palantir is vehemently on board with it already, and uses Claude. </p><p>The point here is less that you're being surveilled (you are) or that extracting something useful out of that data en masse is getting cheaper (it is), but that your data on the cloud increasingly isn't meaningfully yours. </p><p>So I think you should consider backing up your data. It's cheap: a hard drive costs a hundred bucks. It's pretty robust: destroying data on a hard drive typically requires fire or acid, which aren't difficult to protect from acts of god. Against an intelligent adversary, hard drives have the advantage that they're small, encrypted (set it up!), and easy to hide. The riskiest and most vulnerable moment for a hard drive is when it's plugged in, and the rest of the time it's thoroughly airgapped.  It's also reassuring on principle to know you have an entire inert backed up copy of your data that isn't exposed to Google-specific risks, like a court order or Google deciding to permanently shut you off from your account. It also isn't directly exposed to Gemini 4.1 Pro Preview having an existential crisis and wreaking havoc inside Google's servers for the hell of it. </p><p>So what does it take to back up your Google data to a hard drive? Well, I have 1.8 terabytes of Google data from ~4 years of owning a phone (that's because I<a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/archiving\"> </a>archive things, and if you put <a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/archiving\">any kind of effort into archiving,</a> you get alottadata<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a>). Google allowed me to retrieve it at <a href=\"https://takeout.google.com\">takeout.google.com</a>: it took ~a week to gather up my data, and then gave me 40-odd links to click on to set off 40 individual downloads. This being clunky and error prone (browser download managers aren't great), I asked Claude to make a download manager for me, which you can use extremely easily by just pasting this link into Claude Code: <a href=\"https://github.com/Croissanthology/takeout-choo-choo\">https://github.com/Croissanthology/takeout-choo-choo</a>.</p><p>It'll still require a few clicks’ worth of work besides issuing the takeout request in the first place, but Claude basically does the rest. Downloading took me 2 days (including troubleshooting), and I had to keep my macbook in one place for this, as moving it around with the hard drive could’ve interrupted downloads. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"742\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:742,&quot;width&quot;:1000,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tXt5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F30f01d55-4385-43e6-aa90-44f8695fd875_1000x742.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">It goes TOOT TOOT for every 1GB added to the drive</figcaption></figure></div><p>If you have less than 1.8 terabytes in your Google account, this is going to be much easier and quicker for you. Myself, I intend to back up my Google account with a new hard drive every 6-months-to-a-year, like HPMOR!Voldemort casting a new horcrux every time he murders someone. </p><div class=\"embedded-post-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:190559052,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://vishalblog.substack.com/p/beta-uploading-a-survey&quot;,&quot;publication_id&quot;:4912470,&quot;embedding_publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;vishalblog&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RIpc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f0933ee-f7d7-4a33-b4aa-53f543c1631f_1280x1280.png&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Beta Uploading: A Survey&quot;,&quot;truncated_body_text&quot;:&quot;Updated version of this blog post. Will be expanded into a sequence.&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-03-11T07:57:19.335Z&quot;,&quot;like_count&quot;:5,&quot;comment_count&quot;:7,&quot;bylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:7631988,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Vishal Prasad&quot;,&quot;handle&quot;:&quot;vishalprasad1&quot;,&quot;previous_name&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/39556ac6-ae4b-434c-bfc1-4101ab01255e_2214x2214.jpeg&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:null,&quot;profile_set_up_at&quot;:&quot;2025-05-03T21:55:32.085Z&quot;,&quot;reader_installed_at&quot;:&quot;2025-11-20T19:26:26.854Z&quot;,&quot;publicationUsers&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:5010787,&quot;user_id&quot;:7631988,&quot;publication_id&quot;:4912470,&quot;role&quot;:&quot;admin&quot;,&quot;public&quot;:true,&quot;is_primary&quot;:true,&quot;publication&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:4912470,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;vishalblog&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;vishalblog&quot;,&quot;custom_domain&quot;:null,&quot;custom_domain_optional&quot;:false,&quot;hero_text&quot;:&quot;Uh..................................................................&quot;,&quot;logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4f0933ee-f7d7-4a33-b4aa-53f543c1631f_1280x1280.png&quot;,&quot;author_id&quot;:7631988,&quot;primary_user_id&quot;:7631988,&quot;theme_var_background_pop&quot;:&quot;#FF6719&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2025-05-03T21:55:48.511Z&quot;,&quot;email_from_name&quot;:null,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;Vishal Prasad&quot;,&quot;founding_plan_name&quot;:&quot;Founding Member&quot;,&quot;community_enabled&quot;:true,&quot;invite_only&quot;:false,&quot;payments_state&quot;:&quot;enabled&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:null,&quot;explicit&quot;:false,&quot;homepage_type&quot;:&quot;newspaper&quot;,&quot;is_personal_mode&quot;:false,&quot;logo_url_wide&quot;:null}}],&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null,&quot;status&quot;:{&quot;bestsellerTier&quot;:null,&quot;subscriberTier&quot;:null,&quot;leaderboard&quot;:null,&quot;vip&quot;:false,&quot;badge&quot;:null,&quot;paidPublicationIds&quot;:[],&quot;subscriber&quot;:null}}],&quot;utm_campaign&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"EmbeddedPostToDOM\"><a class=\"embedded-post\" native=\"true\" href=\"https://vishalblog.substack.com/p/beta-uploading-a-survey?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web\"><div class=\"embedded-post-header\"><img class=\"embedded-post-publication-logo\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RIpc!,w_56,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f0933ee-f7d7-4a33-b4aa-53f543c1631f_1280x1280.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"embedded-post-publication-name\">vishalblog</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-title-wrapper\"><div class=\"embedded-post-title\">Beta Uploading: A Survey</div></div><div class=\"embedded-post-body\">Updated version of this blog post. Will be expanded into a sequence…</div><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-wrapper\"><span class=\"embedded-post-cta\">Read more</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-meta\">7 months ago · 5 likes · 7 comments · Vishal Prasad</div></a></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>I recommend doing this, by the way. It's cheap and fun. You could be taking so many more pictures of your city in its mundane beauty (a reflection of light on a trash can, the contents of a recycling bin in your neighborhood, the hundred curtained windows of the local commieblock, every person and car in the busy town square, etc.)<br><br>Archeologists in 2026 are absolutely delighted when they discover a Roman landfill. <a href=\"https://croissanthology.com/on-stress\">Their successors will be no different!</a> I mean look at this, imagine being a historian and coming across an image like this to understand 2026 San Francisco:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png\" width=\"1254\" height=\"795\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:795,&quot;width&quot;:1254,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1702060,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://croissanthology.substack.com/i/197472137?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F75c9528b-cb56-4dda-a52d-0a9a2015dbce_1254x795.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7mIU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%